{"id":"trueno","lemma":"trueno","pos":"noun","rank":4700,"glosses":["a clap of thunder","thunder"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾweno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"truenos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-trueno.wav","examples":[{"text":"El trueno se hizo más fuerte.","en":"The thunder became louder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/72128","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"strong"}]},{"text":"A ella le dan miedo los truenos.","en":"She is frightened of thunder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691991","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"dan"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Después del rayo, vino el trueno.","en":"After the lightning, came the thunder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704439","words":[{"g":"later"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"beam, ray"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Escuché truenos en la lejanía.","en":"I heard it thunder in the distance.","words":[{"g":"to listen to","l":"escuchar"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"El trueno asustó a los estudiantes.","en":"The thunder frightened the students.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to scare","l":"asustar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"student","l":"estudiante"}]}]}